## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to model nonstationary, real-world acoustics with online Bayesian tracking and performance under sensor dropouts.

## Key Concepts

- Bayesian online convolutive ICA for time-varying mixing
- Online whitening and fixed-point demixing under nonstationarity
- Handling mic dropouts and strict latency constraints
- Ground-truth SDR/SIR evaluation in dynamic environments

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code for online update (high level)
function update(W, X, prior) {
  // whitening
  const Xw = whiten(X);
  // track M(t) via prior
  const M = smoothTrack(W, prior);
  // update demixing
  W = demixUpdate(Xw, M);
  return W;
}
```

